1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,766
If the zombie apocalypse starts on a cruise ship, and the whole ship heard you start the engines...

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,300
they're coming up to the bridge. All of them.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,151
Rule one. Use the fire hoses, not weapons.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,201
Water pushes back a whole crowd. A bat only stops one.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,340
Rule two. Seal the decks behind you.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,696
Every door you close is one less way up.

7
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,243
Rule three. Abandon ship only when you can see land.

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,331
Out here, a lifeboat is just a smaller ship.

9
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,649
And there it is.

10
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,313
So you lower the lifeboat. Together, this time.

11
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,037
The harbour is right there.

12
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,282
But every single light is out.
